{"version":1,"key":"card:648","content":{"id":648,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"预后（Prognosis）是一个医学术语，是医生基于患者当前的状态，对疾病的发展趋势和最终局面所做的预测。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常见描述："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"预后良好：治疗效果好，完全康复概率很大"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"预后一般：可能会留下一些后遗症，恢复较慢，但不危及生命"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"预后不良：治疗难度大，病情可能会恶化，恢复慢，甚至有可能危及生命"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"预后谨慎：病情复杂，难以预测，需要进一步的进行观察"}]}]}]}],"tags":["医学/术语"],"createTime":1767054518345,"updateTime":1767144095281,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1767144095281}}